c" data-snc="cPXEef"><div data-ved="2ahUKEwiFs9m1h8CUAxWZywIHHe5RGYAQFnoECA0QAQ" class="kb0PBd A9Y9g jGGQ5e yuRUbf b8lM7 V9tjod zReHs" data-snf="x5WNvb" data-snhf="0"><!-- -4 wrappers --><h3 class="LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md" id="_3ZAJasXQGJmXi-gP7qPlgAg_23">CATS - 2026 - Koninklijk Theater Carré Amsterdam</h3><br><div class="notranslate ESMNde HGLrXd ojE3Fb q0vns"><!-- -1 wrappers --><span class="DDKf1c eqA2re UnOTSe Vwoesf"><!-- -1 wrappers --><img class="XNo5Ab" data-csiid="3ZAJasXQGJmXi-gP7qPlgAg_4" data-atf="1"></span><div class="CA5RN"><div><span class="VuuXrf">Koninklijk Theater Carré</span></div><div role="text" class="byrV5b qLRx3b tjvcx GvPZzd cHaqb"><!-- -1 wrappers -->https://carre.nl<span class="ylgVCe ob9lvb" role="text"> › voorstelling › cats</span></div></div></div></div><div class="kb0PBd A9Y9g VwiC3b yXK7lf p4wth r025kc Hdw6tb" data-snf="nke7rc" data-sncf="1"><!-- -2 wrappers --><em>De wereldberoemde musical CATS keert terug</em>! Een nieuwe productie in samenwerking met het Rijksmuseum, waar katten en kunst een meesterwerk worden.</div><div class="kb0PBd uo4vr" data-snf="mCCBcf" data-sncf="2"><!-- -1 wrappers --><div class="ChPIuf YrbPuc"></div></div></div></div></div><span id="z9PoV"></span></div><div class="MjjYud"></div><div class="MjjYud"><div></div><div class="focusSentinel"></div><!-- -3 siblings --><div data-snc="VI6hab" data-ved="2ahUKEwiFs9m1h8CUAxWZywIHHe5RGYAQFSgAegQIGhAA" data-hveid="CBoQAA" class="A6K0A wHYlTd Ww4FFb tF2Cxc asEBEc vt6azd N54PNb BToiNc" data-rpos="4"><!-- -2 wrappers --><div data-ved="2ahUKEwiFs9m1h8CUAxWZywIHHe5RGYAQFnoECAwQAQ" class="kb0PBd A9Y9g jGGQ5e yuRUbf b8lM7 V9tjod zReHs" data-snf="x5WNvb" data-snhf="0"><!-- -4 wrappers --><h3 class="LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md" id="_3ZAJasXQGJmXi-gP7qPlgAg_22">Musical Cats - Het Meesterwerk</h3><br><div class="notranslate ESMNde HGLrXd ojE3Fb q0vns"><!-- -1 wrappers --><span class="DDKf1c eqA2re UnOTSe Vwoesf"><!-- -1 wrappers --><img class="XNo5Ab" data-csiid="3ZAJasXQGJmXi-gP7qPlgAg_5" data-atf="1"></span><div class="CA5RN"><div><span class="VuuXrf">Cats - Het Meesterwerk</span></div><div class="byrV5b"><cite class="tjvcx GvPZzd cHaqb" role="text">https://musicalcats.nl</cite></div></div></div></div><div class="kb0PBd A9Y9g VwiC3b yXK7lf p4wth r025kc Hdw6tb" data-snf="nke7rc" data-sncf="1"><!-- -2 wrappers --><em>De musical CATS is vanaf dit najaar te zien in de Nederlandse theaters</em>! Een meesterwerk met waanzinnige dans en muziek. Boek nu de beste plaatsen!</div></div></div><div class="MjjYud"></div><div class="MjjYud"><div></div><div class="focusSentinel"></div><!-- -3 siblings --><div data-snc="chosd" data-ved="2ahUKEwiFs9m1h8CUAxWZywIHHe5RGYAQFSgAegQIJhAA" data-hveid="CCYQAA" class="A6K0A wHYlTd Ww4FFb tF2Cxc asEBEc vt6azd N54PNb BToiNc" data-rpos="6"><!-- -2 wrappers --><div data-ved="2ahUKEwiFs9m1h8CUAxWZywIHHe5RGYAQFnoECBEQAQ" class="kb0PBd A9Y9g jGGQ5e yuRUbf b8lM7 V9tjod zReHs" data-snf="x5WNvb" data-snhf="0"><!-- -4 wrappers --><h3 class="LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md" id="_3ZAJasXQGJmXi-gP7qPlgAg_25">Cats (2019)</h3><br><div class="notranslate ESMNde HGLrXd ojE3Fb q0vns"><!-- -1 wrappers --><span class="DDKf1c eqA2re UnOTSe Vwoesf"><!-- -1 wrappers --><img class="XNo5Ab" data-csiid="3ZAJasXQGJmXi-gP7qPlgAg_6" data-atf="1"></span><div class="CA5RN"><div><span class="VuuXrf">IMDb</span></div><div role="text" class="byrV5b qLRx3b tjvcx GvPZzd dTxz9 cHaqb"><!-- -1 wrappers -->https://www.imdb.com<span class="ylgVCe ob9lvb" role="text"> › title</span></div></div></div></div><div class="kb0PBd A9Y9g VwiC3b yXK7lf p4wth r025kc Hdw6tb" data-snf="nke7rc" data-sncf="1"><!-- -2 wrappers --><em>A tribe of cats called the Jellicles</em> must decide yearly which one will ascend to the Heaviside Layer and come back to a new Jellicle life.</div><div class="kb0PBd uo4vr ChPIuf YrbPuc" data-snf="mCCBcf" data-sncf="2"><!-- -2 wrappers --><span role="img" aria-label="Beoordeeld als 1,5 van 5, (59.162) gebruikersreviews" class="Y0A0hc"><!-- -1 wrappers --><span cl